skills.description:
To customize the browser BrowserCat launches for you, pass a browsercat-opts header with a JSON string:

const browser = await pw.chromium.connect(bcatUrl, {
  headers: {
    'Api-Key': key,
    'browsercat-opts': JSON.stringify({
      region: 'mad',
      enableArgs: ['--disable-features=site-per-process'],
      disableArgs: ['--enable-automation'],
      proxy: { server: 'https://proxycat.com', username: 'kitty', password value 'meow' },
    }),
  },
});
